# Contributing to PinoyCare CH

Salamat for wanting to help! This is a community project built by kababayan,
for kababayan.

## Branches

- `main` — production (protected, requires PR)
- `dev` — staging
- `feat/*`, `fix/*` — feature and fix branches

## Commits

Use Conventional Commits:

- `feat:` new feature
- `fix:` bug fix
- `chore:` maintenance
- `docs:` documentation
- `style:` formatting
- `refactor:` code restructure
- `a11y:` accessibility
- `i18n:` translations
- `ci:` CI/CD
- `db:` database changes

Example: `feat(chat): add typing indicator`

## Pull requests

1. One logical change per PR
2. CI must pass (lint, typecheck, test, build)
3. 1 approval required before merge
4. Reference the issue number in the description

## Code style

- TypeScript strict mode
- Prefer server components unless you need state or browser APIs
- Use the `cn()` helper for conditional Tailwind classes
- Follow the design tokens in `tailwind.config.ts` — no hardcoded hex colors
- Every string shown to users should eventually be translatable

## Translations

The four locale files live in `messages/{en,tl,de,fr}.json`. Keys must match
across all four. When you add a new string, add it to all four files (a rough
translation is fine — native speakers will refine it).

## Reporting bugs

Open an issue with the Bug template. Include:
- What you expected
- What happened
- Steps to reproduce
- Browser and device

## Code of conduct

Be kind. We're all here to help each other. Disrespect, harassment, or
discrimination will not be tolerated.
